      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Web API (backend for the website)\nThe website (index.html on Vercel) cannot talk to Supabase or Claude directly. Instead it sends a request to this workflow's **webhook**, a web address that starts the workflow, and the workflow sends an answer back.\n\nEach request says what it wants in a field called **action**:\n- list: show the upcoming deadlines\n- add: save a typed deadline\n- add_file: save deadlines from a photo or PDF\n- delete: remove one deadline\n\nAdding uses the same Extract & Save sub-workflow as the Telegram bot, so both give the same results.\n\nEvery answer includes the header Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *. Without it, the browser would block the answer (this rule is called CORS).\n",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "d2c441d0-be67-4fb1-b35d-1a699d422287",
      "name": "Note: overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        224
      ]
    },
